<title>UK: Carlton prices 200 million stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Carlton prices 200 million stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by lead manager BZW has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CARLTON COMMUNICATIONS PLC</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     7.625     MATURITY    06.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.92    PAY DATE    06.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.295    SPREAD	+65 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.50 PCT GILT DUE 2006</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
